{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XR7namKmC8B7utUsL4W1cq","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"commits\":[{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-01T11:40:12Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"amoghakshintala@gmail.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc0ODY5Nw==\",\"login\":\"user\",\"name\":\"Amogh Akshintala\"},{\"email\":\"noreply@x.ai\",\"id\":\"\",\"login\":\"\",\"name\":\"Grok 4.7\"},{\"email\":\"cursoragent@cursor.com\",\"id\":\"U_kgDOC972lw\",\"login\":\"cursoragent\",\"name\":\"Cursor\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-01T11:41:11Z\",\"messageBody\":\"The model table selects Cursor through an enum, and jobs consume a normalized result. Argv, the binary, stream parsing, and doctor probes stay inside the cursor backend.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Grokcommit 11f331457b39f20c4faa8d4476cfe857b33dcd88\nAuthor: Amogh Akshintala <amoghakshintala@gmail.com>\nDate:   Thu Oct 1 04:40:12 2026 -0700\n\n    refactor: hide cursor-agent behind a Backend enum\n    \n    The model table selects Cursor through an enum, and jobs consume a normalized result. Argv, the binary, stream parsing, and doctor probes stay inside the cursor backend.\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Grok 4.7 <noreply@x.ai>\n    Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n src/backends/cursor.rs                    | 238 ---------------\n src/backends/cursor/doctor.rs             | 356 ++++++++++++++++++++++\n src/{ => backends/cursor}/doctor_tests.rs |   1 +\n src/backends/cursor/mod.rs                | 484 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n src/backends/mod.rs                       |  86 ++++++\n src/backends/types.rs                     |  15 +-\n src/capability.rs                         |  53 ----\n src/cli.rs                                |  25 +-\n src/cli_info.rs                           |  45 +--\n src/cursor_bin.rs                         |  48 ---\n src/doctor.rs                             | 337 ++-------------------\n src/finalize.rs                           |  60 ++--\n src/job.rs                                |   6 +-\n src/job/tests.rs                          |  33 +-\n src/lib.rs                                |   2 -\n src/models.rs                             |   3 +-\n src/output.rs                             |  30 +-\n src/status_record.rs                      |   2 +-\n src/stream.rs                             |  21 +-\n src/types.rs                              |  59 ----\n 20 files changed, 1080 insertions(+), 824 deletions(-)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"daed6cef-788d-4be7-9254-e50472bc43cc","uuid":"dd557af6-83d7-47a9-849c-59e5600c053d","timestamp":"2026-10-01T11:41:55.705Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"commits\":[{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-01T11:40:12Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"amoghakshintala@gmail.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc0ODY5Nw==\",\"login\":\"user\",\"name\":\"Amogh Akshintala\"},{\"email\":\"noreply@x.ai\",\"id\":\"\",\"login\":\"\",\"name\":\"Grok 4.7\"},{\"email\":\"cursoragent@cursor.com\",\"id\":\"U_kgDOC972lw\",\"login\":\"cursoragent\",\"name\":\"Cursor\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-01T11:41:11Z\",\"messageBody\":\"The model table selects Cursor through an enum, and jobs consume a normalized result. Argv, the binary, stream parsing, and doctor probes stay inside the cursor backend.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Grokcommit 11f331457b39f20c4faa8d4476cfe857b33dcd88\nAuthor: Amogh Akshintala <amoghakshintala@gmail.com>\nDate:   Thu Oct 1 04:40:12 2026 -0700\n\n    refactor: hide cursor-agent behind a Backend enum\n    \n    The model table selects Cursor through an enum, and jobs consume a normalized result. Argv, the binary, stream parsing, and doctor probes stay inside the cursor backend.\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Grok 4.7 <noreply@x.ai>\n    Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n src/backends/cursor.rs                    | 238 ---------------\n src/backends/cursor/doctor.rs             | 356 ++++++++++++++++++++++\n src/{ => backe