{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YAaokhtn8BmrMszpTMuqDy","type":"tool_result","content":"## Parent\n\n#4\n\n## What to build\n\nPrefactor for the new backends. Each backend owns its binary resolution, argument building from (model, capability, cwd, session), stream parsing into the progress snapshot and a normalized result (text, session id, usage, optional reported cost, error), resume method, and doctor checks. The model table's `backend` field selects it. Cost comes from the model table unless the backend reports its own.\n\nCursor is the only implementation; behaviour is unchanged.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Nothing outside the cursor backend knows cursor-agent's flags or stream format.\n- [ ] Cursor parser tests run on the recorded cursor fixtures.\n- [ ] All existing tests pass unchanged.\n\n## Blocked by\n\n- #13 Contract: remove MCP and rename to delegate\nsrc/types.rs:6:    Ask,\nsrc/types.rs:8:    WriteUnsandboxed,\nsrc/types.rs:14:            Self::Ask => \"ask\",\nsrc/types.rs:15:            Self::WriteUnsandboxed => \"write-unsandboxed\",\nsrc/types.rs:21:            \"ask\" => Some(Self::Ask),\nsrc/types.rs:22:            \"write-unsandboxed\" => Some(Self::WriteUnsandboxed),\nsrc/cli.rs:92:        \"read-only\" => Ok((Capability::Ask, \"read-only\")),\nsrc/cli.rs:93:        \"read-write\" => Ok((Capability::WriteUnsandboxed, \"read-write\")),\nsrc/job/tests.rs:29:            capability: Capability::Ask,\nci\tpending\t0\thttps://github.com/user/delegate/actions/runs/36856956101/job/110351626486","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"daed6cef-788d-4be7-9254-e50472bc43cc","uuid":"a05dbaec-c849-4033-88ac-74e4035c3d08","timestamp":"2026-10-01T11:42:08.331Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"## Parent\n\n#4\n\n## What to build\n\nPrefactor for the new backends. Each backend owns its binary resolution, argument building from (model, capability, cwd, session), stream parsing into the progress 