{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfbTRuz6eckeiyJFH3ypX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"VERDICT: CHANGES\n\nP2 src/backends/mod.rs:27 — The ruling's interface is `argv(model, capability, cwd, session)` plus `parse`, `resume_args` and doctor probes. `Backend` has no `cwd` parameter, no `parse` and no `resume_args`. `parse_stdout` is a free function on `cursor`, and resume is just `session: Option<&str>` passed to `argv`. — Add `Backend::parse` and `resume_args` as `match` methods, and `cwd` to `argv`, since #16 and #17 depend on the shape.\n\nP2 src/job/tests.rs:15, src/finalize.rs:127 — Criterion \"existing tests pass unchanged\" and ruling 6 allow import-only changes. `spec_of` now uses `bin: \"agent\"` and `argv: [\"run\"]`. `fake_finalize` and `to_run_output_maps_raw` change behaviour and signature, and a new test is added. The `BackendResult` reshape forces some of this. — Revert the gratuitous `spec_of` edit. Justify the rest in the PR body, since the \"unchanged\" criterion is otherwise unmet.\n\nP3 src/cli_info.rs:102, src/doctor.rs:153 — `Backend::from_name(\"cursor\")` hardcodes a single backend. Doctor will skip pi and claude when #16 and #17 land. — Iterate over the backends configured in the model table.\n\nP3 src/backends/cursor/mod.rs:165 — A bad model (empty stdout, exit 1) uses the stderr text as the error. The ruling says it is built from the exit code and stderr, but `clean_exit` is a bool, so the exit code is lost. — Carry the exit code into `finish`.\n\nP3 src/types.rs:6 — `Capability::Ask` and `WriteUnsandboxed` are still the internal names, while the spec calls them read-only and read-write. Ruling 2 says to delete the non-spec capability modes. — Rename them to `ReadOnly` and `ReadWrite`, or note why that is deferred.\n\nCI was still pending at the time of review. I did not run the tests.\n\nSTATUS: DONE_WITH_CONCERNS"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2120,"cache_read_input_tokens":58059,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2120},"output_tokens":740,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"daed6cef-788d-4be7-9254-e50472bc43cc","uuid":"34176c1c-11d0-4579-a23a-c08f6ef9998a","timestamp":"2026-10-01T11:42:18.758Z","request_id":"req_011CfbTRubHsAyi1Hqw8JQV6"}
